# Certificate Directory
# This directory is used to store SSL/TLS certificates for HTTPS support.
#
# For development:
# Generate self-signed certificates with:
#   openssl req -x509 -nodes -days 365 -newkey rsa:2048 \
#     -keyout certs/server.key \
#     -out certs/server.cert \
#     -subj "/CN=localhost"
#
# For production:
# Use certificates from a trusted CA like Let's Encrypt
#
# Files expected:
# - server.key: SSL private key
# - server.cert: SSL certificate
#
# IMPORTANT: Never commit actual certificate files to version control.
# Add server.key and server.cert to .gitignore
